<title>ITALY: BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTHOLZ, Italy 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from a World Cup</p>
<p>biathlon race on Saturday:</p>
<p>Women's 7.5 km race:</p>
<p>1. Uschi Disl (Germany) 23 minutes 16.8 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Ann Elen Skjelbreid (Norway)    23:36.7</p>
<p> 3. Corinne Niogret (France)	  23:37.3</p>
<p> 4. Eva Hakova (Czech Republic)     23:44.3</p>
<p> 5. Annette Sikveland (Norway)	23:50.4</p>
<p> 6. Shumei Yu (China)		   23:59.2</p>
<p> 7. Galina Koukleva (Russia)	  24:08.0</p>
<p> 8. Gunn Margit Andreassen (Norway) 24:08.2</p>
<p> 9. Hiromi Seino (Japan)		24:09.0</p>
<p> 10. Christelle Gros (France)	 24:09.3</p>
</text>
